# shooter.tas: a fight in the snow arena. 60 ticks each second.
# The keyboard and the mouse move, look and fire. A gamepad moves too.
# mouse_move gives the look: 400 pixels turn the view about one radian.

# Walk forward to the cover of the low block.
30 keydown W
120 keyup W
# Look down a little, then fire bursts across the yard.
